- audio.js hook: call start/end sound functions inside handleStartClick and onFinish callback.
- Per-bug stats hook: extend state.metrics with perBugStats and update in onFinish.
- Winner/loser visual effects hook: add CSS classes to bug-runner elements in onFinish.
